# Style rules that do not suit this project's prose and are disabled:
#   MD013 line length      - documentation wraps at 80 but tables and URLs cannot
#   MD029 ordered lists    - sequential numbering (1. 2. 3.) is intentional
#   MD036 emphasis         - used for callouts, not as headers
#   MD026 header puncts    - questions in headers end with "?"
#   MD024 duplicate header - repeated section names across checklists
rules "~MD013,~MD029,~MD036,~MD026,~MD024"
